# Claim Ledger — {{domain}}

Running log of factual claims made across all learning modules.

## How to Use This File

- Every specific factual claim (dates, numbers, names, technical specs) is logged here.
- Claims are marked as `[verified]`, `[unverified]`, or `[disputed]`.
- When you verify a claim, update the status and add the verification source.
- If no source exists, keep the claim marked `[unverified]` or remove it from learning materials.
- Material-grounded claims must include Material ID / Location.
- Confidence, source type, and freshness risk are required for auditability.

